{"id":"3bd2a42af0edd0d9","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-special-class-perfect.md","title":"特殊有效闭类的完美性与嵌入边界","display":"thm-special-class-perfect — 特殊有效闭类的完美性与嵌入边界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-special-class-perfect","aliases":["20-thm-special-class-perfect"],"display":"thm-special-class-perfect — 特殊有效闭类的完美性与嵌入边界","chapter":"9","section":"9.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 9.1.1 后的完美性结论","source_printed_pages":[175],"source_pdf_pages":[207],"depends_on":["[[20-df-special-class]]","[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]","[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-special-class-perfect"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-special-class-perfect</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-special-class-perfect — 特殊有效闭类的完美性与嵌入边界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9"},{"key":"section","html":"9.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 9.1.1 后的完美性结论"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>175</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>207</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Special}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Special}(C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=[T]\">\\(C=[T]\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 可计算。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"17bb91b14aad762c\" href=\"?note=17bb91b14aad762c\" title=\"20-df-special-class\">20-df-special-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"49047c938f7aef20\" href=\"?note=49047c938f7aef20\" title=\"20-thm-effective-compactness\">20-thm-effective-compactness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ecb9f43e837dcf35\" href=\"?note=ecb9f43e837dcf35\" title=\"20-df-computable-tree-embedding\">20-df-computable-tree-embedding</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" href=\"?note=14fc2af0ac27dcbb\" title=\"20-df-cantor-bendixson\">20-df-cantor-bendixson</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special-class-perfect}\\vdash\nD(C)=C\\quad\\land\\quad |C|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\neg\\exists g\\ \\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special-class-perfect}\\vdash\nD(C)=C\\quad\\land\\quad |C|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\neg\\exists g\\ \\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>孤立路径可计算，故特殊类没有孤立点。任一与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 相交的柱都含两个不同成员，可在其内部选两个不相交且仍与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 相交的更小柱。按有限二进制串递归作此选择，并让长度严格增长；每个无限域路径给一个极限点，不同域路径给不同点。因此有连续统多个成员；反向是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 子集。</p>\n<p>上述分裂选择只证明集合论完美性。若存在普通可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>，沿全 0 域路径取并即可计算一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 成员，与特殊性矛盾。因此不能从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\">\\(T^{\\mathrm{ext}}\\)</span> 完美偷换为可计算完美嵌入。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 175 / PDF 207。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-special-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-effective-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-effective-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-special-class","status":"resolved","id":"17bb91b14aad762c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-effective-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"49047c938f7aef20","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-tree-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-bendixson","status":"resolved","id":"14fc2af0ac27dcbb","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-df-computable-tree-embedding]]；see [[20-df-cantor-bendixson]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Special}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"C=[T]","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}special-class-perfect}\\vdash\nD(C)=C\\quad\\land\\quad |C|=2^{\\aleph_0}\\quad\\land\\quad\n\\neg\\exists g\\ \\operatorname{PerfectEmbed}(g,T).","display":true},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"T^{\\mathrm{ext}}","display":false}],"bytes":1785,"backlinks":[{"id":"82c784c7ecf8f649","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-special-class]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-low-basis]]；see [[20-thm-special-class-perfect]]；see [[20-thm-effective-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-cantor-compactness]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。"}],"outgoing":["17bb91b14aad762c","49047c938f7aef20","ecb9f43e837dcf35","14fc2af0ac27dcbb"]}